Current Dev Position: YP 4.0 rc2

Next Deadline: 29th April 2022 YP 4.0 final release

 

Next Team Meetings:

*	Bug Triage meeting Thursday Apr.14th 7:30 am PDT (
<https://zoom.us/j/454367603?pwd=ZGxoa2ZXL3FkM3Y0bFd5aVpHVVZ6dz09>
https://zoom.us/j/454367603?pwd=ZGxoa2ZXL3FkM3Y0bFd5aVpHVVZ6dz09)
